    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Verbs with «ter»",
     "texto": [
      "**manter** (to keep), **obter** (to obtain), **conter** (to contain), **reter** (to retain), **deter** (to detain). They are conjugated like **ter**: **mantenho** (I keep), **obténs** (you obtain), **obtém** (he / she obtains).",
      "The prefix changes the meaning: **ter** (to have), **manter** (to keep), **obter** (to obtain)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Examples",
     "texto": [
      "**Mantenho a calma** (I keep calm). **Obtive o diploma** (I obtained the diploma). **O frasco contém sal** (the jar contains salt). **Deteve o ladrão** (he / she detained the thief)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
